Package: SCRNAnalysis
Type: Package
Title: Single-Cell RNA-Seq Analysis, Clustering and Annotation
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: person("Giuseppe", "Bocci", email = "giuseppe.bocci@mail.test.it", role = c("aut","cre"))
Description: Defines a ScDeconvExperiment class extending
    SingleCellExperiment and provides tools for single-cell RNA-seq
    exploratory analysis, quality control, highly variable gene selection,
    clustering, cell type annotation, and visualization of cluster-cell type
    relationships.
